<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n16315" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄσκωμα</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ατος</span>, τό, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀσκός</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>leather padding</i> or
			<i>lining</i> of the hole which served for the rowlock, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Ach.</u>
				97
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ra.</u>
				364
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> any
				<i>swelling,</i> such as on the female <i>breast,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ruf.
				<u>Onom.</u>
				92
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				2.163
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>leathern bellows,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Apollod.
				<u>Poliorc.</u>
				153.3
			</span></i>:—
				Dim.
			
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀσκωλι-άτιον</span></b> , τό, <i><span class="en">
				Hero
				<u>Spir.</u>
				1.39
			</span></i>.</div>
